Side effect to know about: `npm run battery` rewrites batteries/slice1-battery.json, which is in
MANIFEST.txt. After running it, `node scripts/gate-manifest.mjs` reports
`MANIFEST FAIL (hash): batteries/slice1-battery.json` until `node scripts/regen-manifest.mjs` is
re-run (acceptance-run.sh does this at step 14, before the gate at 15). The delivered state is
unaffected; see finding F5 in the review.